#ASSERT (`s 3(1) the person is associated with the other person` WITH `the context of the provision otherwise requires a different meaning` IS FALSE, `the person is within paragraph (a) of section 3(1)` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is within paragraph (b) of section 3(1)` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is within paragraph (c) of section 3(1)` IS (JUST TRUE), `the person is within paragraph (d) of section 3(1)` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is within paragraph (e) of section 3(1)` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is within paragraph (f) of section 3(1)` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is within paragraph (g) of section 3(1)` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is taken to be associated by virtue of paragraph (b), (c), (e) or (f) despite section 3(3)` IS (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
